sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant CL as Clinician
participant EHR as HIS_Country_A
participant MPI as MPI
participant TS as Terminology Server
participant PH as Public Health Server

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, PH: Phase 1: Patient lookup and registration
EHR->>MPI: Query Patient<br/>PDQm ITI-78 <G>
MPI-->>EHR: ITI-78 Response - matching Patient<br/>(200 OK match / 200 OK no match /<br/>404 Not Found)
opt 200 OK - no match found
EHR->>MPI: Register Patient<br/>PIXm ITI-104 <G>
MPI-->>EHR: 201 Created - Patient created<br/>(400 / 422 OperationOutcome on error)
EHR->>EHR: Query registered patient<br/>again (step 1)
end
opt 404 Not Found - identifier domain not recognised
MPI-->>EHR: 404 Not Found (OperationOutcome)
EHR->>EHR: Adjust identifiers and<br/>restart from step 1
end
end

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, PH: Phase 2: Record suspected case / event
CL->>EHR: Record suspected case<br/>(Condition, provisional, onset date)
EHR->>EHR: Notification rule:notifiable + suspected,<br/>open generic and disease-specific forms
end

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, PH: Phase 3: Complete notification forms and standardise codes
CL->>EHR: Complete Epi Questions <br/>(QuestionnaireResponse), generic + disease specific
EHR->>EHR: Collect existing EHR data as FHIR resources<br/>(Patient, Encounter, Immunization, Observation)

opt Optional - local codes in use
EHR->>TS: Translate event code and answers to regional codes<br/>SVCM ITI-101 Translate Code <G>
TS-->>EHR: ITI-101 Response - translated regional code(s)<br/>(200 OK result=true + regional code, 200 OK result=false - no mapping / 4xx OperationOutcome)
end
EHR->>EHR: Build notification message (Bundle.type = message)<br>(MsgHeader,Patient, COndition, Immunization,QuestionnaireResponse (genereic), QuestionnaireResponse(disease Specific))
end

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, PH: Phase 4: Notify Public Health (<G> = routed via Gazelle)
EHR->>PH: Submit notification message Bundle <G><br/>HL7 FHIR R4 Messaging - $process-message
PH->>PH: Register notification<br/>+ assign ID
PH-->>EHR: Response message <G> MessageHeader.response.identifier = request message ID<br>(200 OK: ok / duplicate / transient-error / fatal-error, 400 / 422 OperationOutcome)
end